// expect: refuse E_EffectMismatch
// ABSENCE under polymorphism: run's row variable is instantiated with E
// through the lambda — the textbook higher-order leak. The gate must
// refuse; a row system without sound negation-under-instantiation
// admits this silently.
effect E { op() -> Int }
fn run(f) = f()
fn bad() with !E = run(() => op())
fn main() = bad()
